Parent parity epic: #2

Upstream baseline: DesktopCommanderMCP 0.2.52 / c774c3b505de990219637ecdc9a830c8772fae9d

## Gap
Package MTerm-CLI so a clean user can install/run it through npm tooling (registry, approved GitHub package, or npm-supported Git source) without cloning the development checkout. `npx`/installed bin must launch the MCP server from outside the repo. Verify packed allowlist, production dependencies, uninstall behavior, and no GUI/Electron dependency.

## Acceptance
- behavior is implemented through the actual installed MCP server;
- Codex can discover/call it through the compatibility surface;
- deterministic positive and negative tests cover boundaries/error cases;
- output is bounded and secrets are not logged;
- platform status is explicit;
- parity roadmap links this issue and records evidence/stage;
- issue closes only after acceptance evidence is committed and the parity suite is green.

## Current state
Open parity gap; closing this issue is required for the 100% PASS gate.

